:PATH
Section 6 Commencement
|

:INFO
Art. 35
1 Subject to paragraph 2, this Ordinance shall come into force on 1 January 1999.
2 Articles 26 and 27 come into force at the same time as the Ordinance on the Organisation of the Federal Chancellery of 5 May 1999 .
|

